                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c975c41-734f-323e-b3a2-a5ed1972f2bc",
                                        "entry_id": "93939675-b497-3a90-8e2c-5ea630dba338",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something ripped off or stolen; a work resulting from plagiarism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "345d56df-5137-41be-a106-aafe302ff9b1",
                                                "sense_id": "8c975c41-734f-323e-b3a2-a5ed1972f2bc",
                                                "text": "Well that's because groups are now releaseing^([sic]) music in their packs as well as vgas and rips. It^([sic]) you check out some local area code groups I'm sure you'll find high quality ansi if the group is good enough."
                                            },
                                            {
